## 2. 特征（Trait）

### 2.1 定义特征

```rust
trait Summary {
    fn summarize(&self) -> String;
}
```

### 2.2 为类型实现特征

```rust
struct Article {
    headline: String,
    author: String,
}

impl Summary for Article {
    fn summarize(&self) -> String {
        format!("{}, by {}", self.headline, self.author)
    }
}
```

### 2.3 默认实现

```rust
trait Summary {
    fn summarize(&self) -> String {
        String::from("(Read more...)")
    }

