### 方式 5: Props 传递回调函数

**父组件**

```vue
<template>
  <ClosedOrder :on-refresh="handleRefresh" ... />
</template>

<script setup>
const handleRefresh = () => {
  // 父组件的刷新逻辑
  refresh();
};
</script>
```

**子组件**

```vue
<script setup>
